  "notes": [
    "The library unit gate includes the new private frame-safety regression. Parallel36 is split into35 functional tests and one affinity-aware scaling test.",
    "Rust and Native historical frozen families retain their exact earlier source/runtime identities. These gates do not adopt a new Native family.",
    "An incorrect multi-target Cargo batch filled available space while linking its third target. Existing two completed executables were run separately and archived after qualification; targets are serialized thereafter.",
    "Cold artifact recovery verifies original and decoded identities and durably records recovery before unlinking. Sources, frozen families, providers and measured benchmark inputs remain plain.",
    "Subsequent canonical MVar documentation adds comments only; unchanged declaration tokens are checked separately before the next frozen compiler epoch."
  ],
